returned (AC-026); oversize transcript â†’ zero received requests (AC-026); connection drop â†’ exactly one received 
request; listed rejections classified pre-processing; unlisted/mid-stream classified counted (AC-029 classification); 
override ignored under `NODE_ENV=production`. Usage effects of these outcomes are T12's evidence.
Covers: FR-016, FR-020, AC-026, AC-029
