nothing until Apply; Apply stores exactly edited summary and accepted items, one version), AC-012 (text received by 
the fake provider for .vtt/.srt has no cue numbers/timestamps/settings and keeps speakers), AC-013 (name matching; 
request contains no roster), AC-016 (each failure outcome's counting), AC-025 (stale notice refused; admitted 
operation completes on P), AC-026 (oversize refused, zero received requests, usage unchanged; cancellation before send 
