8:/**
9: * Phase 6 meeting-notes E2E world (T5; SPEC AC-001, AC-014, AC-015, AC-020).
10: *
11: * Company A is the messaging seed's shared company (primary = admin, secondary
12: * = member). Notes of company A are written through the REAL routes with a
13: * signed-in page's cookies (POST /api/meeting-notes, POST .../items), and a
14: * space is deleted through the real DELETE /api/spaces route. Only state no
15: * product route may create for the caller is trusted SQL on the LOCAL database
16: * (loopback only, helpers/local-db-url.ts): dedicated spaces of company A (so a
17: * test's listing never mixes with notes of earlier runs) and a second company B
18: * with its own space, member row, and note (the isolation probe).
19: *
20: * Every name starts with MEETING_NOTES_E2E_PREFIX; `cleanup` removes what the
21: * test created and the global setup sweeps what interrupted runs left.
22: */
23:export const MEETING_NOTES_E2E_PREFIX = 'MN E2E';
24:const E2E_EMAIL_PATTERN = 'mn-e2e-%@local.test';
