**Analyzing note deletion and cache issues**

I'm tracking how deleting notes affects stale caches and participant views, especially with hard reloads clearing 
caches. I’m also looking at form behavior when hitting item limits—like how the UI drops unsaved input without alerts 
when adding many action items—and checking version history details to understand participant membership flags and 
display data.
**Reviewing former member flags and audio cleanup**

I’m digging into how former member flags appear in version history and the lack of unit tests for integration logs. 
I’m also checking the impact of unmounting audio controls in Notes—making sure audio streams and contexts clean up 
properly—and verifying date parsing and filename sanitization for edge cases with invalid years.
